Z||000046||c m west||04-03-2001||01:43 PM||||well I guess I was wrong about those headers, I thought you guys meant the Sprint Headers that Phil selld down there at FOCOA. If The y tube that comes with this set fits the motor ( meaning doesnt make contact with the throttle body ) then yes, the tube will work - If I am wrong - send it back and I will refund you - no worries...<P>Eric - West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> <BR>310-305-4111<BR>||||reg||1
